# No Empty Fallbacks
RULE: Never use `""`, `[]`, or `{}` as fallbacks for required config. Fail loud with clear error.
WHY: Empty fallbacks hide configuration errors and make debugging impossible.
CODEX: 06-coding-standards/validation-patterns.md, .cursor/rules/hardening-standards.mdc
DO: Use `os.environ["KEY"]` or raise ValueError; Pydantic required fields; explicit validation
NEVER: `os.getenv("KEY", "")`; `config.bucket or ""`; defensive isinstance to hide type errors
